Copyright (c) 1984-1986 TCS Trommeschlaeger Computer GmbH and the G-DOS
authors. Preserved for research and historical documentation. No licence
is granted or implied; this is not ours to license. Rights holders
wishing removal may open an issue.

Reconstruction output in this repository is not evidence about stock
G-DOS behaviour and must not be cited as such.

5. External tools

This project uses trsextract and the sdltrs-MultiHDC emulator, both
maintained separately:

  https://github.com/Egbert-Azure/trsextract
  https://github.com/Egbert-Azure/sdltrs-MultiHDC

Their licensing is stated in those repositories and is not restated
here.

